0..77 Comment "// Transport along `ua` by the family\'s shape, the HoTT book\'s § 2.10 at the"
78..158 Comment "// families of Theorem 2.6.4 and § 2.12. A family that never reads its argument"
159..236 Comment "// keeps the value. A product, a sum and a list carry the value part by part."
237..307 Comment "// Each holds by conversion and by a run, along the loops\' path to the"
308..382 Comment "// integers, `ua(winding)`, where a loop is carried to its winding number."
384..455 Comment "// The circle, the presented integers, the winding number and spinning."
